{{!-- Sidebar tab navigation — rendered inside the wh40k-sidebar container.
     Single vertical column of full-width buttons (#320): the nav stacks in one
     column on every sheet width rather than reflowing into two columns when wide.
     Styling applies to PC and NPC sheets.

     The nav background is NOT set here: tailwind/legacy-components.js's
     `nav.wh40k-navigation` gives it rgba(0,0,0,0.2), and that is what has always
     rendered. A priority-flagged `tw-bg-transparent` used to sit in navClass and
     never took effect (the legacy rule out-specified it while both were flagged);
     re-adding it would strip the strip's tint on every PC and NPC sheet. --}}
